// Deepcore — items.ron
//
// Every item the player can hold, carry or smelt.
//   stack      maximum stack size (1 for tools and wearables)
//   category   Material | Block | Tool(...) | Wearable(...) | MachineKit | Container(...)
//   places     for Block items: the block id that gets placed
//   color      icon colour, linear RGB 0..1 (icons are drawn procedurally from this)
//
// Tool energy: None | Steam { capacity } | Battery { capacity } | CoreCell { breaks }
// The tier ladder is 1 (steel) -> 2 (hardened steel) -> 3 (steam) -> 4 (tungsten carbide)
// -> 5 (nuclear); `area` is the face size mined per action.
[
    // ---------------------------------------------------------------- raw ores and rock
    (id: "dirt", name: "Dirt", category: Block, places: Some("dirt"), color: (0.30, 0.22, 0.14)),
